Self / Dakota Kai, played by Cheree Crowley.

9
00:07:32,903 --> 00:07:38,903
Self / Robbie Brookside, played by Robert Brooks.

10
00:08:23,225 --> 00:08:29,225
Natalie Katherine Neidhart-Wilson (née Neidhart; born May 27,
1982) is a Canadian-American professional wrestler.

11
00:09:13,548 --> 00:09:19,548
She is signed to WWE, where she performs on the Raw
brand under the ring name Natalya.

12
00:10:03,870 --> 00:10:09,870
She also wrestles on the independent circuit under her
real name, stylized as Nattie Neidhart.

13
00:10:54,193 --> 00:11:00,193
She is a two-time women's world champion, having won the WWE Divas
Championship and WWE SmackDown Women's Championship once each.

14
00:11:44,516 --> 00:11:50,516
She is also a former one-time WWE Women's Tag Team Champion (with Tamina).

15
00:12:34,838 --> 00:12:40,838
A third generation wrestler, Neidhart is a member of the Hart wrestling family through her mother,
and is also the daughter of Hart Foundation member and Hall of Famer Jim Neidhart.

16
00:13:25,161 --> 00:13:31,161
She trained in the Hart family Dungeon under the
tutelage of her uncles Ross and Bruce Hart.

17
00:14:15,483 --> 00:14:21,483
From 2000 to 2001, she worked for the Matrats promotion,
before debuting for Stampede Wrestling in 2003.

18
00:15:05,806 --> 00:15:11,806
In 2004 and 2005, she wrestled abroad in England and Japan.

19
00:15:56,129 --> 00:16:02,129
She became the inaugural Stampede Women's Pacific Champion in 2005,
and won the SuperGirls Championship the following year.

20
00:16:46,451 --> 00:16:52,451
In 2007, Neidhart signed with WWE and spent time in Deep South Wrestling (DSW), Ohio Valley
Wrestling (OVW), and Florida Championship Wrestling (FCW) developmental territories.

21
00:17:36,774 --> 00:17:42,774
While in FCW, she managed her cousin, Harry Smith, and her husband, T.J.

22
00:18:27,096 --> 00:18:33,096
She debuted on the main roster in 2008, allying herself with Victoria.

23
00:19:17,419 --> 00:19:23,419
The following year, she and Wilson were joined by
Smith to form The Hart Dynasty.

24
00:20:07,741 --> 00:20:13,741
In 2010, Neidhart won the Divas Championship.

25
00:20:58,064 --> 00:21:04,064
In 2017, she became the SmackDown Women's Champion
after defeating Naomi at SummerSlam.

26
00:21:48,387 --> 00:21:54,387
She is the first woman in WWE history to hold both the Divas
Championship and the SmackDown Women's Championship.

27
00:22:38,709 --> 00:22:44,709
From 2013 to 2019, Neidhart appeared in the reality television series Total
Divas, the sole consistent main cast member across all nine seasons.

28
00:23:29,032 --> 00:23:35,032
She has set six records as recognized by the Guinness Book of World Records for female WWE wrestlers – most pay-per-view
appearances, most matches, most wins, most Raw matches, most SmackDown matches, and most WrestleMania matches.

29
00:24:19,354 --> 00:24:25,354
Neidhart is the longest-tenured female WWE wrestler,
actively being with the company since 2007.

30
00:25:09,677 --> 00:25:15,677
The film explores themes of comeback, knee injury, sports injury, pro wrestling.
